<title>THAILAND: Thai 1996 c/a gap seen widening to 8.3 pct of GDP.</title>
<headline>Thai 1996 c/a gap seen widening to 8.3 pct of GDP.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Finance Minister Amnuay Viravan said on Friday that Thailand's current account deficit in 1996 is likely to widen to 8.3 percent of gross domestic product from 8.1 percent last year.</p>
</text>
